[help]
{100}{}{none}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Defeated}
{1020}{}{Slaver Points Gun}
{1030}{}{Pointed Gun}
{1040}{}{Slaver}
{1050}{}{Slave}
{2000}{}{Are you slavers? [ The man who you are guessing is the sheriff looks at you closely. ]}
{2010}{}{Yes we are.}
{2020}{}{Time to die.}
{3000}{}{Just know we won't go down without a bloodly fight.}
{3010}{}{As expected. [Draw weapon]}
{3020}{}{Maybe, but I've heard a thing or two about your town.}
{4000}{}{Heard what? [ The sheriff lowers his guard for a second. ]}
{4010}{}{I heard you folks are running out of food, is that true?}
{4020}{}{I've heard you're all gonna die by my hands!}
{4030}{}{I've heard you're desperate... Out of survival options.}
{5000}{}{H-how do you know that?.. [ The sheriff looked fairly shocked losing his composure. ]}
{5010}{}{Because we had some men knock off the town that was helping you awhile back.}
{5020}{}{Uhh.. I don't know.}
{6000}{}{Are you trying to strike us down while we're weak? We don't have food but we have plenty of bullets, you fuck!}
{6010}{}{You got me all wrong, I've come to give you food in exchange for a few slaves.}
{6020}{}{Yes we have, c'mon men lets kill them!}
{7000}{}{Why the fuck should we trust you or take up that offer in the first place if you're the one causing the damn food shortage!?}
{7010}{}{You shouldn't [ Point your weapon at the man's head. ]}
{7020}{}{Cause if you don't we have enough fire power to take down this shit stain of a town, but I'd rather not waste ammo.}
{7030}{}{Enough of this, lets kill these shitheads!}
{8000}{}{[ The man and the people around him would flinch, preparing to defend themselves. ] Oh shit-}
{8010}{}{[Shoot ]}
{8020}{}{But what choice do you have?}
{9000}{}{Damn it, fine.. My guards will maybe kill a few of you and then you'll enslave all of the town instead of just some of it. Take your pick you freaks..}
{9010}{}{Glad we came to an agreement.}
{10000}{}{If this town is so shit, why do you want some of us as slaves?}
{10010}{}{For fun you little prick.}
{10020}{}{Because I doubt every one of you are worthless like you, I have an eye for potential and I'll pick who is worth taking.}
{11000}{}{You are doing this for fun!? That's it, we're gonna die trying or kill you sons of bitches!}
{12000}{}{Well, shit.. What about after you give us the food? I want this arrangement to be temporary, not constantly slaving my people away hoping some people finally kill you freaks.}
{12010}{}{I've already given you a good enough offer, you'll accept it or die.}
{12020}{}{Damn, I- uh.. Already given you, your options and you can either take them or uh.. Or fucking leave them!}
{12030}{}{Well, Uh, we could given you some farming supplies and the food, how about that?}
{12040}{}{Ugh, I've had enough of this, eat lead!}
{13000}{}{Well, fuck you and your options you fucking asshat!}
{14000}{}{How about some hunting supplies too, I don't think just farming supplies will be enough.}
{14010}{}{Erm, actually.. I think farming supplies would be more than enough to feed the rest of your town after we take some slaves.}
{14020}{}{Nah, I think we'll just kill you.}
{14030}{}{Fine, we'll give you the food, the farming supplies and the hunting supplies but this better be worth it.}
{15000}{}{Fine, we'll just take the farming supplies and the food. All the sla...people you need to take, are ready. [ The sheriff lowers his weapons, you could see a look of disgust on his face, you can't tell if he's disgusted at you or himself. ]}
{15010}{}{About damn time.}
{16000}{}{Alright.. I'll assign some people to come with you. [ The sheriff looked down towards the ground, hiding his face. ]}
{16010}{}{Took long enough.}
{17000}{}{*the slaver points a weapon at the sheriff's head* shit}
{18000}{}{Who are you? [ The man who you are guessing is the sheriff looks at you closely. ]}
{18010}{}{I escaped the Burner.}
{18020}{}{No one.}
{19000}{}{Look, we have enough attention from these fuckers.}
{19010}{}{You gotta help me somehow.}
{19020}{}{Cowards.}
{20000}{}{Hm, alright. Talk to Sullivan, he can take you further north. Wyoming border. But you can't stay here.}
{20010}{}{Thanks, sheriff.}
{21000}{}{[The gun is pointed at the sheriff's head]}
{21010}{}{[Leave]}
{22000}{}{Please leave town. We've made a deal.}

